{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-master-static-landing-js","path":"/property-services/property-management/","result":{"data":{"strapiPage":{"publish":true,"strapi_id":69,"id":"ab6755a5-552d-5e8c-b50b-21972d3c5f78","page_name":"Property Management","page_class":"Property_Snagging","menu":{"title":"Property Management","page":{"layout":"landing_page","id":"ab6755a5-552d-5e8c-b50b-21972d3c5f78","publish":true,"page_name":"Property Management","strapi_id":69},"strapi_parent":{"slug":"property-services","title":"Services","publish":true,"link_type":"internal","id":31},"link_type":"internal","slug":"property-management","strapi_id":72,"id":"9d7f13f0-a330-59e7-91e2-8cf7aa21637a"},"layout":"landing_page","reviews":[{"text":"I was having a hard time finding reliable tenants for my rental property. Zoya Ventures Real Estate stepped in and took over the tenant screening process. Within just two weeks, they found a wonderful tenant, making the entire experience hassle-free. Their attention to detail and professionalism truly set them apart. They handled everything from background checks to lease agreements, ensuring I had peace of mind throughout the process. I highly recommend their services to anyone struggling to find the right tenants for their property!","strapi_id":13,"stars":"five","ggfx_results":[{"src_cftle":"i/man_icon_98ac9e68af.png","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/70x70/man_icon_98ac9e68af.webp","transform":"70x70","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/70x70/man_icon_98ac9e68af.png","transform":"70x70","format":"png"}]}],"pages":[{"id":"ab6755a5-552d-5e8c-b50b-21972d3c5f78"}],"name":"Ahmed M.","id":"646e9d6c-2ed4-513a-b6b1-081bcf9b6dda","date":"2024-06-12","title":"Finding Reliable Tenants Quickly","image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/man_icon_98ac9e68af.png"}},{"text":"Being an overseas property owner, managing maintenance issues was quite challenging. Zoya Ventures Real Estate's team managed everything, from urgent repairs to routine maintenance, ensuring my property remained in excellent condition. Their prompt communication and efficiency have been a game-changer for me. They kept me informed every step of the way and took care of all maintenance issues promptly, which gave me great peace of mind. Thanks to them, I no longer worry about my property from afar and can focus on other important matters.","strapi_id":14,"stars":"five","ggfx_results":[{"src_cftle":"i/women_icon_db5442e706.png","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/70x70/women_icon_db5442e706.webp","transform":"70x70","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/70x70/women_icon_db5442e706.png","transform":"70x70","format":"png"}]}],"pages":[{"id":"ab6755a5-552d-5e8c-b50b-21972d3c5f78"}],"name":"Sarah L.","id":"bd8fe8fe-4199-514c-9e22-4b8309f75759","date":"2024-04-16","title":"Overseas Property Management Made Easy","image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/women_icon_db5442e706.png"}},{"text":"I had a difficult situation with a tenant that needed to be evicted. Zoya Ventures Real Estate's team expertly navigated the legal process and handled the eviction professionally and ethically. They quickly found new, reliable tenants and managed the transition seamlessly. Their expertise and support during this stressful time were invaluable. They ensured all legal aspects were covered and that the property was ready for new tenants in no time. Their efficiency and professionalism made a potentially stressful situation much more manageable.","strapi_id":15,"stars":"five","ggfx_results":[{"src_cftle":"i/man_icon_98ac9e68af.png","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/70x70/man_icon_98ac9e68af.webp","transform":"70x70","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/70x70/man_icon_98ac9e68af.png","transform":"70x70","format":"png"}]}],"pages":[{"id":"ab6755a5-552d-5e8c-b50b-21972d3c5f78"}],"name":"John D.","id":"6969f84e-bd5d-523b-af6e-534d02db9e4c","date":"2024-05-21","title":"Stress-Free Tenant Eviction and New Tenants","image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/man_icon_98ac9e68af.png"}},{"text":"My rental property was deteriorating due to poor maintenance by previous managers. Zoya Ventures Real Estate stepped in, conducted a thorough inspection, and promptly addressed all the maintenance issues. They implemented a proactive maintenance plan that significantly improved the property's condition and value. Their dedication and service have been impressive. They scheduled regular inspections and maintenance, ensuring that my property always looked its best and retained its value. I am delighted with their comprehensive approach to property management.","strapi_id":16,"stars":"five","ggfx_results":[{"src_cftle":"i/women_icon_db5442e706.png","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/70x70/women_icon_db5442e706.webp","transform":"70x70","format":"webp"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/70x70/women_icon_db5442e706.png","transform":"70x70","format":"png"}]}],"pages":[{"id":"ab6755a5-552d-5e8c-b50b-21972d3c5f78"}],"name":"Priya R.","id":"c3b7a20a-6341-5c7e-adb5-13db9e73b790","date":"2024-07-20","title":"Revitalizing Property Value Through Proactive Maintenance","image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/women_icon_db5442e706.png"}},{"text":"As a first-time landlord, I was overwhelmed by the responsibilities of managing my rental property. Zoya Ventures Real Estate's team guided me through every step, from preparing the property for rent to managing tenant relations. Their detailed reporting has been crucial for my accounting, and their responsive support has made my experience as a 