 property management.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We protect your property, deposits, and tenants for rentals in Dubai, handling rental collection, condition reports, and maintenance oversight. Our collaborative approach ensures faster, higher-quality service, and greater transparency, setting us apart.</span></p>"}},"video_url":null,"heading":null,"icon_stats":[],"bg_color":"white","image_fit":null,"style":null},{"id":"9f10f23d-b03b-5241-8882-89311646855b","title":"Explore what we do as your trusted property manager","strapi_id":36,"strapi_component":"modules.our-services","slider":null,"is_grid":true,"grid_count":"three","design_title":{"data":{"design_title":""}},"cta":null,"services":[{"strapi_id":216,"description":"Our dedicated account manager service provides a single point of contact for all your property needs. Contact us today to simplify your property management experience. ","id":"40ed96a2-4f7e-502c-ad20-abc04f20ea85","image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/tenant_management_8bfb36dff3_7432854de7.jpg"},"cta":{"cta_label":"Dedicated Account Manager","custom_link":null,"isExternal":false,"icon":null,"id":"5d220ae4-b8c7-5f5d-b646-5dbcf6419590","strapi_id":769,"menu":null}},{"strapi_id":217,"description":"Let us take the hassle out of tenant management. We will manage everything from tenant communications to rent collection, ensuring a smooth and efficient rental process.","id":"00bb86f0-6609-500c-99d5-add8e6de75e2","image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/3_bfd51ed0b9.jpg"},"cta":{"cta_label":"Tenant Management","custom_link":null,"isExternal":false,"icon":null,"id":"bf3c6dbf-1e23-5a07-b56f-a138fcd27fed","strapi_id":770,"menu":null}},{"strapi_id":218,"description":"Navigating property laws can be daunting. Our legal guidance service provides you with expert advice to ensure compliance and protect your investments.","id":"57e01ead-ef5a-5887-b957-809307762773","image":{"