9439844-5e42-54db-974f-4c706a361922","title":"FAQs About Zoya Ventures Real Estate Property Management Service Dubai","strapi_id":70,"strapi_component":"modules.faq","cta_text":null,"bg_color":"white","faqs":[{"strapi_id":1959,"question":"How do I choose the right property management company in Dubai?","id":"e1aea545-7e92-5256-abb6-c1e27d8133c6","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>When choosing a property management company in Dubai, consider their experience, reputation, range of services, fee structure, and client reviews. It's essential to align their offerings with your specific property management needs.</p>"}}},{"strapi_id":1973,"question":"Do property managers in Dubai handle legal compliance?","id":"b76b1e9e-efa5-5a85-87cf-078030fb4173","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>Yes, property managers in Dubai are responsible for ensuring legal compliance with local, state, and federal housing laws. This includes handling lease agreements, tenant rights, and eviction processes if necessary.</p>"}}},{"strapi_id":1974,"question":"How much does property management cost in Dubai?","id":"8c48a02e-97dd-5996-8518-fb57fbf389fe","answer":{"data":{"answer":"<p>The property type, the range of services offered, and the particular terms negotiated with the property management company are some variables that can affect the cost of property management in Dubai. Usually, the property management service charge is determined as a percentage of the rental income received from the property. Property management costs in Dubai could be between 5% and 10% of the rental revenue.</p>"}}}]},{"id":"f4116691-1dde-52af-b024-4c94596feb94","title":null,"strapi_id":39,"strapi_component":"modules.global-module","heading":null,"choose_module":"reviews_slider","bg_color":null,"cta_text":null,"design_title":{"data":{"design_title":""}}},{"id":"79145fc6-652c-5fb5-bda6-e44bfe9a3905","title":"Speak to our Dedicated Team of Seasoned Professionals","content":{"data":{"content":"<p>Experience stress-free property ma